{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1530685-chole-background-still-an-option-in-m20","id":1530685,"title":"Chole Background still an option in M20?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-12T16:49:00-08:00","id":1530685,"title":"Chole Background still an option in M20?","content":"I'm trying to translate one of my old characters--a Sleeper Chwal in the Bata'a--into the new rules for the M20. She used to have the Chole 4 Background but I don't see it as an option in Sorcerer M20. Has it been overlooked or intentionally omitted? If the latter, and suggestions how to emulate the a Sleeper character being able to be possessed by a Spirit and channeling its Charms? I suppose I could just create a new Path or Numina but perhaps there is a simpler solution I'm overlooking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26676-squiggles","name":"Squiggles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-12T18:22:43-08:00","id":1530689,"title":"","content":"It was omitted from M20 Sorcerer \u2014 one of a large number of issues I have with the book. I recommend picking up the Storyteller's Vault product <a href=\"https://preview.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/347222/Sorcerer-Paths-of-Power\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer: Paths of Power</a>, on which M20 Sorcerer was almost certainly based. If anything, S:PoP is guilty of the opposite crime, of including <i>too many</i> options, if there is such a thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-13T01:18:36-08:00","id":1530722,"title":"","content":"We just house-ruled it back in, along with a few other omitted Backgrounds when we converted characters from Rev. I actually don't know why it was dropped, but I suppose it was making Channeling or Ephemera a more expensive and weaker option. I see it differently, because while Charms are undoubtedly more powerful than borrowing Abilities, possession is a heavy downside that balances this out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpat